WEBVTT

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:07.400
<i>Earth is full of evil demons running rampant.</i>

00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:11.080
<i>But at the same time, Earth has</i>

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:14.390
<i>beings who fight those demons.</i>

00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:23.770
<i>They are known as... magical girls!</i>

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:31.930
Saki-chan! I sense an enemy
 to the west, nupo!

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:35.010
Okay! Then... here I go!

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:53.860
You've finally shown yourself, 
demon Moyosuch!

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:03.370
Saki-chan, be careful, nupo!

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:08.450
I don't know what that devil is saying, 
but I can sense its malice, nupo!

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:12.000
I don't get what you're saying,
 but I definitely understand!

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:21.470
What an attack...

00:01:21.470 --> 00:01:23.030
Are you okay, nupo?

00:01:23.670 --> 00:01:28.070
Look! The part where it hurt 
turned black and white, nupo!

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:31.070
That makes it easier for the colorists, 
but it's still such a waste, nupo!

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:57.760
Color Broadcast

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:56.010
We're in real trouble, nupo!

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:57.090
Why?

00:01:57.760 --> 00:01:59.760
<b>Color Broadcast</b>

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:01.800
If the whole show turns black and white,

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:03.550
viewers who aren't used to it 
will call and complain!

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:07.770
<b>TV Station</b>

00:02:03.550 --> 00:02:06.100
"My TV isn't broken! What kind 
of show are you running?!"

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:09.150
Our show will get canceled three minutes in,

00:02:09.150 --> 00:02:17.060
and they'll spend the remaining time slot 
running beautiful nature shots!

00:02:22.230 --> 00:02:24.480
All right... I'll use <i>that</i> technique!

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:26.910
You mean... the forbidden technique?

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:43.430
Rainbow Miracle Super Delicious 
Pretty Hyper Rainbow Attack!

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:57.380
Punished!

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:01.790
An attack that's treated as spectacular,

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:03.480
but can be animated with optical effects...

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:06.690
A technique well-suited to
 a tightwad like Saki-chan, nupo.

00:03:08.690 --> 00:03:09.660
Saki-chan!

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:13.160
The kickback from that technique... 
it's made me so weak...

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:25.260
To rush into battle, struggle with 
all you have, and then, to fall...

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:28.970
Magical girl... you are beautiful.

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:30.060
Are you...

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:33.290
I am he who protects injured magical girls.

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:35.480
Yes. I am...

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:39.450
Peach Prince!

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:48.570
What are you doing here? I thought 
you'd returned to your kingdom...

00:03:52.230 --> 00:03:54.290
R-Right!

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:02.270
<i>Peach Prince... just who are you, really?</i>

00:04:02.270 --> 00:04:06.800
<i>Ah, but if only I could stay in 
his arms a little while longer...</i>

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:29.400
Freaking hell. It was a dream?

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:05.920
<b>Magical Girl - Transform</b>

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:11.930
I slept through my alarm!

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:14.430
Why didn't you wake me up?!

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:19.690
I tried several times! But you were
 just sleeping so peacefully...

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:21.860
I told you I have to go really far today,

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:24.530
so you had to make sure I was up at 8:00!

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:26.440
I don't have time! I'm heading out!

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:28.030
What about your breakfast?

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:29.280
Don't need it!

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:30.450
Then, Saki...

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:32.700
Take this with you.

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:33.990
Thanks!

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:37.080
Have a good day.

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:44.670
It was when I was around
Saki's age that I...

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:50.510
Hurry! Hurry!

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:58.350
Okay! Gonna give it my all!

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:05.900
Yay!

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:14.620
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:15.990
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:20.830
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:26.630
I wanna be the kind of girl who's in style...

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:32.800
But why is it that I always get hurt?

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:36.220
My fortunes always say "worst luck!"

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:39.020
When I try to act stylish, I fall on my butt!

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:43.350
That's my life: all bad luck and sadness!

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:49.490
When I eat bread with honey, I always drop it...

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:54.990
And why does it always fall honey side down?

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:57.990
Go for it! Oh, me!

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:00.950
If only I had a magic spell...

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:03.580
I like you! Oh, you!

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:06.340
My love could change me!

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:09.590
I believe I can do anything if I try!

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:12.550
And for your sake, I'm sure...

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:15.470
I love you! Oh, you!

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:18.600
I can do anything!

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:21.390
Let's go, let's go! Just watch!

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:23.980
That's my "Honeyed Flash!"

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.150
I can change!

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:30.900
Everyone!

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:34.200
Thanks for coming to Magical 
Twins' concert today!

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:39.620
Our single, "Honeyed Flash! Hey, I Can 
Change!" comes out today! Please buy it!

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:41.750
Please buy it.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:47.250
<b>CD on sale</b>

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:47.250
<b>Flash Concert</b>

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:47.250
<b>Magical Twins</b>

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:47.250
Magical Twins' 
CD for sale

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:47.250
Not a single soul...

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:50.170
Manager... they haven't just instituted

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:52.010
martial law in this part of town, have they?

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:55.260
No, you're just that unpopular.

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:56.760
That's a bit blunt...

00:08:57.510 --> 00:09:03.770
<i>My room's gonna be even more 
stuffed with my own CDs... sob.</i>

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:03.770
Unpopular Idol
Uno Saki

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:06.270
Her Partner
Mikage Sakuyo

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:12.280
Now, here's popular idol unit, STAR*PRINCE!

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:14.150
My brother...

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:24.040
Mohiro-kun's off on another planet, huh?

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:52.020
<b>Mohiro and Hyoe are the popular idol duo!
 Their new single, "Glass Galaxy," is out now! 
Will they top the charts for the 7th time in a row?!</b>

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:27.790
Partner Hyoe-kun, is he hard to work with this way?

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:31.170
No, that's part of Mohiro's charm.

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:34.300
Mohiro-kun? Do you agree that
it's part of your charm?

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:38.970
We get paid separately
 for talk show appearances and singing.

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:41.350
I see.

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:43.680
Don't fight over payment, you two.

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:49.730
Now it's time for them to sing for us!

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:52.020
The song is "Glass Galaxy"!

00:09:54.150 --> 00:10:00.910
You awakened me, millions of light years away

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:06.000
I was charmed by your beautiful aura

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:09.380
I came running

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:12.590
So that I could protect you

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:20.510
Riding on a pearl pegasus

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:25.470
That sparkling soul

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:31.360
Shines clearly through the frosted glass

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:39.070
The fog that obscures the night sky,
 the clouds that cover the morning star...

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:43.660
Not even they can hide your sparkle

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:49.920
Now, put your hand in mine...

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:57.170
Give yourself to me, as I invite you...

00:10:57.170 --> 00:11:03.850
On a stage of stars, millions 
of light years away

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:08.980
Let's dance all night

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:12.480
I was born

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:15.860
So that I could meet you...

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:22.200
<i>This is where the story begins</i>

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:31.120
This week's 
special

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:23.200
That's right. Sakuyo-chan, your brother 
is the black-haired one... Mohiro!

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:28.200
Wow, that's amazing... being 
siblings with a top idol.

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:29.750
Oh? Which means,

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:33.500
Saki-chan, you're childhood friends with 
the super idol Mikage and his sister?

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:33.500
<b>4K Is Where It's At</b>

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:35.000
Huh?

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:39.760
<b>Flash Concert</b>

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:40.420
We weren't exactly childhood friends... I just 
followed them around a lot when we were little...

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:43.260
The truth is, part of why 
I wanted to be an idol

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:46.760
was to get a little closer to Mohiro-chan.

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:51.140
I guess my motives are 
a little less than pure, huh?

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:55.360
And I haven't got closer to 
Mohiro-chan at all yet...

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:56.270
Well...

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:58.400
That's love, huh?

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:00.280
Love power, huh?

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:03.360
Oh, cut that out! What are you talking about?

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:06.280
But no romance for idols, remember?

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:08.620
None of that "I'm gonna be 
a normal girl again!" stuff

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:10.620
or tear-jerking graduation speeches.

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:12.540
No surprise pregnancies, either!

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:14.920
D-Don't worry!

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:16.290
Are you sure?

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:23.340
Let's surpass my brother.

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:28.850
<i>There's still a lot of things 
I have to work hard on...</i>

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:31.430
<i>But I hope things stay
the way they are now.</i>

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:54.540
Well, Saki-chan. Good work today.

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:56.210
Yes, sir! Thanks a lot!

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:59.170
Hey, get the hell out here, dammit!

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:01.590
I know you're in there, dammit!

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:06.930
It's a yakuza...

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:12.980
I... th-think you might have... the wrong...

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:16.150
Oh? Do you live here?

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:21.150
I have a couple questions to ask you, dammit.

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:24.150
Saki-chan! Saki-chan!

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:25.900
You okay?

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:26.910
What on earth...

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:29.530
I wish I'd hid—

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:33.290
Drag drag

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:33.450
Don't worry! As you can see, I'm just fine!

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:35.160
Really? You don't need the police?

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:36.040
Should we call someone?

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:39.460
I'm fine! Totally fine!
I'm good... I think!

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:43.550
<i>I'm not good at all.</i>

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:46.590
Hey, you mind calling the old lady?

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:49.800
Mom! Come quick!

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:51.430
Yes, yes?

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:53.470
How can I help you?

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:57.980
M-Mom... a person of that freelance 
occupation that starts with "Ya" is here...

00:13:58.520 --> 00:13:59.690
Ko-san!

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:02.980
What are you doing here?

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:06.700
Hey. Been a while, eh, Sayo-chin?

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:10.490
Leave. I told you, our arrangement is over.

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:11.950
"S-Sayo-chin"?

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:13.330
That's whatcha think, huh?

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:16.250
But if you think you can shake me, 
you've got another thing coming...

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:20.630
H-Hang on. Those two aren't... 
They couldn't be...

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:25.300
Um, what is... your relationship, exactly?

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:29.260
Yes... I think it's about 
time I told Saki about this.

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:31.890
Y-Yes?

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:35.100
The truth is...

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:39.140
I was a magical girl.

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:49.150
Huh?

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:51.370
Former Magical Girl
Uno Sayori

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:51.740
I was a magical girl.

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:52.530
Huh?

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:55.620
You know what magical girls are, don't you?

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:57.960
It was a very popular 
genre of TV shows, once.

00:14:57.960 --> 00:15:00.500
Yeah, but they're TV shows...

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:04.380
I was scouted by Ko-san here
when I was in middle school.

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:05.420
Who's Ko-san?

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:07.050
She means me, dammit.

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:11.720
<i>Scouted... I thought he'd "scouted" 
her for something totally different...</i>

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:16.100
I spent a long time as 
a magical girl after that...

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:18.560
though, I've never told anyone until now.

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:21.940
By the way, I was her accompanying mascot.

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:25.360
Magical World
Magical Girl Mascot Department
<b>Kokoro-chan</b>

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:25.360
You're kidding! That's such a cute name...

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:28.280
I figured it'd be obvious enough, dammit.

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:30.950
I even got a cute speech tic, dammit.

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:32.450
That's a speech tic?

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:36.120
I think 100 out of 100 people would think 
you were just a certain kind of person...

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:39.710
But you see, I hurt my back last month.

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:42.120
You can't fight the aging 
process, as they say...

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:46.630
Y-You were still doing it until 
last month? I can't even imagine...

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:49.170
Yes. I was still on call until recently.

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:51.130
But I've gotten tired now.

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:55.430
Sayo-chin's the oldest one
 we have in this area.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:59.640
Of course, in this business, you're 
an old hag once you're over fifteen.

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:01.770
That's too harsh...

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:05.400
You've made a lot of enemies 
with those words, you know.

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:10.110
But now, we don't have 
a magical girl to protect this area.

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:13.820
We're gonna need you to 
do a little more, dammit.

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:21.830
Hey, you got a crush on anyone?

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.290
Where'd that come from?!

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:25.670
Well, I'm a teenage girl, you know...

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:28.420
Obviously, I've had a heart-racing 
encounter or two...

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:29.550
How old are you?

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:31.510
F-Fifteen...

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:35.140
Well, you just made it 
under the bar, dammit...

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:35.760
Huh?

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:36.760
Okay!

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:41.640
How's about you contract with me 
and become a magical girl, huh?

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:42.770
Huh?

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:45.020
Huh?!

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:48.770
Yes! Saki-chan, make up for 
your mother's failing back!

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:49.780
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:49.780
H-H-Hold on!

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:51.900
Wait, wait just a minute!

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:55.610
If you become a magical girl, 
you'll get to be, you know...

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:59.990
Stacked as hell and built 
where it counts, dammit!

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:01.830
F-For real?

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:04.210
Sounds like she's in. Now, let's get started.

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:06.500
No, I didn't mean that! Time out, time out!

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:09.460
Sign this contract.

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:11.130
<b>Contract
</b>I hereby agree to the following as I protect all humanity and keep peace in this world.
-To obey the rules of the magical world and see justice through.
-To never abuse magic for personal gain.
-To not reveal my true identity.(*Except under certain circumstances)
-To not complain about any emotional or physical damage I sustain during combat.

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:11.130
This is a lot more mercenary 
than I expected...

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:12.880
There's nothing "magical" about it.

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:16.680
Well, I don't want you 
bitching at us later, dammit.

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:21.140
B-But I'll be fighting some 
pretty crazy monsters, right?

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:26.730
Hey, no sweat. These days, magical girls 
mainly beat up local punks and junk.

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:29.610
Bzzzt bzzzt

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:28.230
There's pretty much no demons or—

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:33.320
Sorry, we got a demon.

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:37.360
Perfect. I can show you what 
they look like, dammit.

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:38.820
I can view it on your smartphone?

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:43.250
The terror of the demons... 
Behold, their hair-raising form!

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:47.620
Squee...

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:49.630
So cute!

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:52.050
Hang on. It's cute?

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:53.880
That makes it more like 
a mascot than you...

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:56.340
Don't be stupid, dammit!

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:58.640
It's obviously just for camouflage!

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:02.060
These things can get built as hell, dammit!

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:03.220
W-What?

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:04.430
They get jacked, I said.

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:07.480
And normal attacks don't work on demons.

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:11.270
Only the special power of 
magical girls can beat 'em!

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:12.940
Magical girls...

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:14.940
There's a person there...

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:19.740
You know him, eh?

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:21.450
M-M-Mohiro-chan?

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:23.950
He must be heading back from the TV studio...

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:26.500
It's true... he's always loved animals.

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:28.870
Hey, there's more of them!

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:31.420
That ain't good, dammit.

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:34.050
Demons abduct humans and take 
them to the underworld.

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:37.550
Mohiro-chan!

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:38.380
Where is he?

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:40.970
Behind the local shrine, dammit!

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:41.850
Got it!

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:44.560
Wait, it's this way!

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:47.430
That kid...

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:50.440
Sayo-chin?

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:52.940
Please...

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:56.070
Sure. Leave it to me, dammit.

00:18:57.440 --> 00:19:00.200
I'll be good to her.

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:03.450
<i>Mohiro-chan! Mohiro-chan!</i>

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:05.450
<i>Mohiro-chan! Mohiro-chan!</i>

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:07.450
<i>Mohiro-chan! Mohiro-chan!</i>

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:10.580
Mohiro-chan! Are you—

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:13.750
I'm too late!

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:15.880
And there's even more of them than before!

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:19.630
Let's go!

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:22.090
Mohiro-chan!

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:26.020
Hey! Once they take him through 
that gate, it's game over, dammit!

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:30.600
They're close!

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:33.610
That's a hell of a lot of demons, dammit...

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:37.530
Please! Tell me how to beat them!

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:38.940
Please!

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:40.030
S-Stop shaking me.

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:42.280
I wanna save Mohiro-chan!

00:19:43.530 --> 00:19:45.660
Please!

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:53.170
Th-This Love Power index...

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:55.630
It can't be...

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:57.460
Hurry!

00:19:57.460 --> 00:20:01.050
F-Fine! Shout the name of the person 
you love as loud as you can! Confess!

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:05.510
What the heck?!

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:07.770
Quit blushing, dammit!

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:10.770
You want him to just disappear?!

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:27.200
No, I don't!

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:33.290
I... I love Mikage

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:37.210
Mohiro-chan!

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:46.100
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:20:46.100 --> 00:20:47.970
<i>What am I...</i>

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:21.010
She did it!

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:20.710 --> 00:23:23.250
<i>Magical Girl rising.</i>

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:27.800
<i>She experiences, for the first 
time, the terror of combat.</i>

00:23:28.340 --> 00:23:30.510
<i>Next time on Magical Girl Ore.</i>

00:23:28.510 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Magical Girl - Ore</b>

00:23:31.220 --> 00:23:34.140
<i>Can Ore survive?</i>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
